00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:31.930
accept your message? Because they're not.

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:33.860
They're not. Because the Muslims were kind of,

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:38.440
um naive to think that because they know Taurat,

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:41.050
