00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:02.739
And Allah says: No, only the ones who [بَلَىٰ مَنْ أَسْلَمَ وَجْهَهُۥ لِلَّهِ]

00:11:02.764 --> 00:11:04.360
the one who submits his face before Allah,

00:11:04.385 --> 00:11:05.960
those are the ones that should be hopeful.

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:09.380
